        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="FrontEnd (Web) Servers" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="468.36" y="408.46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="Load Balancer" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="320" y="408.46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="Load Balancer" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="609.77" y="408.46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="Internet" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="190" y="408.46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="Mobile App" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="50" y="408.46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="End Users" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="50" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="BackEnd Servers" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="774.31" y="408.46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="Databases" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="40" width="111.64" x="1002.97" y="408.46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="I3ffdMRVS8gDNv7Roq-i-10" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;End users access websites via mobile apps or web browsers on their computers over the internet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Users must be authenticated if the data they are requesting is secure data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;A load balancer sends end user requests to a group of web servers, the frontend servers, based on availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The frontend servers’ requests for data, are sent to another load balancer which sends the server requests to the backend servers. The same concept happens here, the requests are sent to the available backend servers, so each is not overloaded with all the server requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The backend servers request data from the databases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;The databases will send data back to the backend servers to answer the server requests of the web servers and delivered to the end users.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Having load balancers and groups of servers in the front and backend serves to increase redundancy. Having more than 1 database is part of the redundancy plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Vertical scaling would be considered for the frontend servers, moving from EC2 instances to ELB instances. Horizontal scaling would be used for the backend or application servers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0in 0in 8pt; line-height: 18.4px; font-size: medium; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="590" width="790" x="1180" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
